1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:04,170
Now we learn content together.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:11,800
Read passage, read questions and choose best answer everyone.

3
00:00:13,310 --> 00:00:18,430
Who receives special reward?

4
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:24,120
A. Lan

5
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:29,360
B. Minh

6
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:34,140
C. Na

7
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:42,570
Friend Na is the one receiving special reward.

8
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:47,440
Tell what friend Na has done?

9
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:55,130
Observe three pictures below, match sentence with suitable picture.

10
00:00:55,740 --> 00:01:00,410
Na sharpens pencils to help friend Lan.

11
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:04,080
Na gives friend Minh half an eraser.

12
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:08,510
Na is class monitor helping tired friends.

13
00:01:19,450 --> 00:01:22,090
Why is friend Na sad.

14
00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:26,030
Choose best answer.

15
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:33,950
A. Na is sad because no one plays with Na.

16
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:42,040
B. Na is sad because Na is too slow.

17
00:01:43,260 --> 00:01:50,040
C. Na is sad because hasn't studied well.

18
00:01:53,020 --> 00:02:01,000
Na is sad because hasn't studied well.

19
00:02:05,150 --> 00:02:09,440
What do friends and teacher do to make Na happy?

20
00:02:09,580 --> 00:02:16,430
Mark D for correct answer, S for wrong answer.

21
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:24,700
Friends and teacher give Na special reward.

22
00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:36,890
After practicing reading and learning lesson, we can see lesson content is:

23
00:02:42,090 --> 00:02:55,160
Story praises a friend who treats friends well so friends love her.

